# Where each agent's API is reachable. The Dashboard calls these directly
# from the browser -- same pattern as each agent's own frontend -- it has no
# backend/database of its own. Both agents run through one server/port (see
# Server/app.py) at different path prefixes; point these at different
# hosts/ports per environment without touching any agent's code.
VITE_RESEARCH_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000/research
VITE_OUTREACH_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000/outreach
